'''Haunted''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2021 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2021|2021 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Haunted appears to have a smokey gray wood-like texture with three pairs of purple eyes along the whole knife.

==Trivia==
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

